Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 02:40:16 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1134/1178] The music half together follows each strength and
 drags them all (1166, part fourteen)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 04.10.2026: «В Креаторе ползунок Music Together не работает. Подсчёт общей силы не
работает. Сам по скрину посчитай». The bar was counted only when the form was painted, never
while a strength was dragged: his screen showed 3.55, the five adapters' first strengths
(1.0 + 0.75 + 0.6 × 3), over 1.55 on the sliders. And it only looked like a slider.

Now a row's music slider brings the bar up to date as it moves, and the bar is a slider of its
own: dragged, it moves every music strength at once, each in proportion to where it stood when
the drag began, none past its own max, on the 0.005 grid with the remainders shared so the sum
lands where it is let go. Shown from two adapters with a music half, so it stays under the hand
that drags them down to nought. Its tip says so in the seven languages. The page test drags a
row and the bar (318 checks).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
